列されている皇女。 通称・薔薇屋敷の君。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から頭が良く、本などもたくさん読んでいるため知識も多く、自分にすり寄ってくる大人の汚さというものを熟知している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため誰にも心を開かず、大変気むずかしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口も悪く意地悪で、使用人たちにも怖れられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、実際は他人思いの優しい少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、人への接し方が分からず、自分自身を持て余してしまっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"612","sourceWorkId":"18794","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"皇位継承第三位に序列されている皇女。 通称・薔薇屋敷の君。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から頭が良く、本などもたくさん読んでいるため知識も多く、自分にすり寄ってくる大人の汚さというものを熟知している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため誰にも心を開かず、大変気むずかしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口も悪く意地悪で、使用人たちにも怖れられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、実際は他人思いの優しい少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ、人への接し方が分からず、自分自身を持て余してしまっている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"42944"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/10d2ba61648e75bce56b9b54f6a91716e9354db779bb1cc17c32d38249660cfc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/28/283459d2b9d899a0e99e03e1fbcbf8c41f29ee39ced9349c228e6cac3077d37e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"松山紗香","creatorId":"vndb:s904","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s904","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s904","name":"松山 紗香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:68128:42944:10662:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c24490","characterName":"鈴蘭","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"42945","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"68128"}],"egsCharacterIds":["614"],"vndbCharacterId":"c24490"},"originalCharacterName":"鈴蘭","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A maid who serves Sakurako. She is innocent, bright, and positive. Even when Sakurako hits her with cold words, she doesn't care."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She intuitively understands that Sakurako is actually a kind person, and she wants to be her best friend. She looks naive, but has a very strong personality."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c24490"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"櫻子に仕える侍女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天真爛漫で明るく、前向き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"櫻子に冷たい言葉で当たられてもどこ吹く風。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"櫻子が実は優しい人であることを直感的に理解しており、自分だけは理解者でありたいと考えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼く見えるがとてもしっかりした性格。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"614","sourceWorkId":"18794","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"櫻子に仕える侍女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天真爛漫で明るく、前向き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"櫻子に冷たい言葉で当たられてもどこ吹く風。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"櫻子が実は優しい人であることを直感的に理解しており、自分だけは理解者でありたいと考えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼く見えるがとてもしっかりした性格。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"42945"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/35/35508f3f669b4982d3b555adfd62da9d7c840453e4463a8e9cde3fba2ffa0c1c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6b/6b7ab2d91d3dd9e115a82a2464c9dede1723a89a0a484bca81494abe558831fd.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高田初美","creatorId":"vndb:s363","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s363","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s363","name":"高田 初美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:68128:42945:5052:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c24491","characterName":"朝霧","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"42946","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"68128"}],"egsCharacterIds":["615"],"vndbCharacterId":"c24491"},"originalCharacterName":"朝霧","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An old friend of Munekata and the proprietress of a cafe in town."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"There is an atmosphere of flirt in each of her movements, and she is really atractive. For some reason, she took a liking to Munakata, who was a pious man, and she took great care of him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c24491"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"宗方の昔なじみで、街のカフェの女主人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"立ち振る舞いの一つ一つに雰囲気があり、色っぽい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"朴念仁な宗像のことを何故か気に入り、なにかと世話を焼いていた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"615","sourceWorkId":"18794","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"宗方の昔なじみで、街のカフェの女主人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"立ち振る舞いの一つ一つに雰囲気があり、色っぽい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"朴念仁な宗像のことを何故か気に入り、なにかと世話を焼いていた。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"42946"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1c/1c331a37953e7375387c71822e2d7e9daed1b174133017a3beb6195633342b09.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4bf18e08f6e0b0b52c632a70c15a8f8855c7d94ed3c42a8d5d170a3a425e5648.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"瑞沢渓","creatorId":"vndb:s28","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28","name":"瑞沢 渓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:68128:42946:5741:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c83247","characterName":"宗方","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["613"],"vndbCharacterId":"c83247"},"originalCharacterName":"宗方","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The main character of this story. He is a strong warrior who is even called a national hero."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With his blessed physique and inexhaustible courage, he ran through many battlefields and achieved great results."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has a very serious and honest personality. He is the inflexible Park Yeon-in."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although his subordinates and colleagues liked him because of his personality, his superiors often disliked him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"This time, his assignment to protect the Princess was also at the request of the higher-ups who were jealous of his popularity and disliked him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c83247"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作の主人公。 国の英雄とまで言われる屈強な戦士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その恵まれた体躯と無尽とも言われる勇気で数多くの戦場を駆け抜け、戦果を挙げてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は馬鹿が付くほどまじめで正直者。 融通の利かない朴念仁。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その性格のせいで部下や同僚には好まれたものの、上官には疎まれることが多かった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回の皇女殿下警護の任も、彼の人望を妬み疎ましく思った上層部の意向によるものである。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"613","sourceWorkId":"18794","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/17/17d7c30d680f6d7116b233fafaf34e82cf82ba157160d4430816bd1b473de7c4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/13/1362109e2abaedc5fbc688bae8d3721f69da736e58a5d274434d29bae15e8abd.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c83248","characterName":"橘子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"42947","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"68128"}],"egsCharacterIds":["616"],"vndbCharacterId":"c83248"},"originalCharacterName":"橘子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","st